  "title": "Fat Magret Museum & KGB Cell 🏰⚓🕵️‍♂️",
  "date": "2025-06-07T21:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "Fat Magret Museum & KGB Cell 🏰⚓🕵️‍♂️\n\nI visited the Fat Magret Museum in Tallinn, located in the charming Old Town. 🏙️ The museum has a variety of maritime exhibits, including historic ships and even a submarine! 🚢 My favorite part? The rooftop view of the harbor—it’s a perfect spot for snapping photos. 📸✨\n\nJust around the corner is The KGB Cell, a museum dedicated to the history of the KGB in Estonia. 🕶️ The cell is a small, dark room used for interrogations and imprisonment during the Soviet era—a chilling but fascinating experience. ⚡",
